  "body": "Hi,\nThank you for the quick response and pushing the tentative fix! 🙏\n\nI built it in my local environment and confirmed that there are no crashes, even when changing parameters.\n\nI'm sorry, but I don't know the root cause. However, I suspect it was a string length or encoding issue in the Japanese translation file causing memory corruption during GUI rendering.\n\nThank you again for the quick response and great fix! ✨\n\nI hope this fix will be helpful for more users.",
